```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization invitation issue --help
Issue an organization invitation

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization invitation issue [OPTIONS] <--principal-id <PRINCIPAL>|--email <EMAIL>> <ORGANIZATION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug

Options:
      --principal-id <PRINCIPAL>       Invite an exact active principal ID
      --email <EMAIL>                  Invite one email address
      --json                           Print the invitation result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
